      "notes": "Re-read from the 2.1.293 /model picker on 2026-10-07: Opus 5.5, Fable 5.1, Sonnet 5.5, Haiku 5.5 (the `haiku` alias now runs claude-haiku-5-5, with a Low to Max effort rail, default Medium, which replaces Haiku 4.5 at the user's request), then older models (Sonnet 5, Opus 5, Fable 5, Opus 4.8, 4.7, ...). The `sonnet` alias runs claude-sonnet-5-5, so Sonnet 5.5 replaces Sonnet 5, and Opus 5 is not listed: the user asked that Sonnet 5.5 and Opus 5.5 fully replace Sonnet 5 and Opus 5 wherever both are offered. Opus 5.5 is one `opus[1m]` row: the picker has no 200K Opus and `claude -p --model opus` reports a 1,000,000-token window, so the 200K `opus` twin was removed at the user's request and the model menu shows no Context Window choice for it. The older models are not listed, and neither are sonnet[1m] and fable[1m], which `claude --model` accepts but the picker never offers."
    },
